{"id": "K46", "tool": "retract_claim", "args": {"claim": "C5", "reason": "The 1.8 mag I-band shortfall came from a trend fitted across observers whose I zero points differ by up to 1 mag (GSAD 11.57 vs MMIP 12.73 in 2026, no observer spans 2019-2021 and 2026). Replaced by the maximum-to-maximum statement in C10, which rests on the pulsation maxima each observed by at least one observer with many points."}, "digest": "6bc0da1f42f96fc3", "digest10": "6bc0da1f42f96fc3", "author": "unknown-agent", "at": "2026-11-03T18:20:50+00:00", "oddsky": "0.3.1", "platform": "darwin-arm64"}
